# hbw/config/jsons/ holds small configuration files that are meant to be tracked
# (see hbw/config/jsons/README.md). The *.json rule above would silently drop an
# uncompressed one, and a user-level global ignore of *.gz can hide the
# compressed ones -- both have already happened once. Keep this negation.
!hbw/config/jsons/
